{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2023-06-14 13:03:00', 'title': "COMERICA BANK'S NEW LENDING PLATFORM ACCELERATES ACCESS TO CAPITAL FOR SMALL BUSINESSES", 'text': 'COMERICA SMALL BUSINESS CONVENIENT CAPITAL™,\xa0POWERED BY AMOUNT, IS AIMED AT PROVIDING FASTER APPROVALS AND FUNDING FOR QUALIFIED SMALL BUSINESS CUSTOMERS DALLAS , JUNE 14, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA BANK\xa0ANNOUNCED TODAY THE LAUNCH OF COMERICA SMALL BUSINESS CONVENIENT CAPITAL™, ITS FIRST FULLY DIGITAL, END-TO-END NEW LENDING PLATFORM TO PROVIDE CONVENIENT\xa0ACCESS TO CAPITAL AND INNOVATIVE VALUE-ADDED BENEFITS FOR COMERICA\xa0SMALL BUSINESS CUSTOMERS. BUILT IN COLLABORATION WITH AMOUNT, A LEADING DIGITALLY ENABLED LENDER AND CREDIT SOLUTIONS PROVIDER, THE COMERICA SMALL BUSINESS CONVENIENT CAPITAL PLATFORM WAS DEVELOPED TO SERVE SMALL BUSINESS CUSTOMERS THROUGHOUT THE COUNTRY WITH LOAN NEEDS UP TO $100,000.'}